@startuml sequence-lesson
title 【シーケンス図】レッスン・レッスングループ

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  ActorBorderColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBackgroundColor White
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999

actor Client
participant "LessonGroupController" as LGController
participant "LessonController" as LController
participant "CourseController" as CController
participant "LessonGroupApplicationService" as LGAppService
participant "LessonApplicationService" as LAppService
participant "LessonGroupDomainService" as LGDomainService
participant "LessonDomainService" as LDomainService
participant "LessonGroupRepository" as LGRepo
participant "LessonRepository" as LRepo
participant "CourseRepository" as CourseRepo
database "DB" as DB

note over Client
  GET /api/courses/{courseId}/lessons、GET /api/courses/lessons/export、
  POST /api/courses/{courseId}/lessons/import は CourseController が受け付ける。
end note

note over Client
  全APIはJWT認証済みであることが前提（認証・JWT検証の詳細は「認証」シーケンス図を参照）
end note

' ============================================================
' レッスングループ新規作成
' ============================================================
== レッスングループ新規作成 (POST /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups) ==

Client -> LGController : POST /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups\n{ title }

LGController -> LGAppService : createLessonGroup(LessonGroupCreateCommand)

LGAppService -> CourseRepo : findCourseById(courseId)
CourseRepo -> DB : SELECT FROM courses WHERE id = ?
DB --> CourseRepo : Optional<Course>

alt コースが存在しない
  LGAppService --> LGController : ResourceNotFoundException
  LGController --> Client : 404 Not Found
  note right of LGAppService
    存在チェックをしないまま登録すると外部キー制約違反となり、
    クライアント起因の誤りが500として返ってしまうため、事前に検証する。
  end note
else コースが存在する
  CourseRepo --> LGAppService : Course

  LGAppService -> LGDomainService : issueLessonGroupOrder(courseId)
  LGDomainService -> LGRepo : 当該コースの最大lessonGroupOrderを取得
  LGRepo -> DB : SELECT MAX(lesson_group_order) WHERE course_id = ?
  DB --> LGRepo : maxOrder
  LGRepo --> LGDomainService : maxOrder
  LGDomainService --> LGAppService : 新しいOrder（末尾に追加）

  LGAppService -> LGRepo : createLessonGroup(LessonGroup.create(..., order))
  LGRepo -> DB : INSERT INTO lesson_groups
  DB --> LGRepo : 作成されたLessonGroup
  LGRepo --> LGAppService : LessonGroup

  LGAppService --> LGController : LessonGroupDto
  LGController --> Client : 200 OK { id, courseId, lessonGroupOrder, name, ... }
end

' ============================================================
' レッスングループ更新
' ============================================================
== レッスングループ更新 (PUT /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}) ==

Client -> LGController : PUT /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}\n{ title }

LGController -> LGAppService : updateLessonGroup(LessonGroupUpdateCommand)

LGAppService -> LGRepo : findLessonGroupById(lessonGroupId)
LGRepo -> DB : SELECT WHERE id = ?
DB --> LGRepo : Optional<LessonGroup>

alt レッスングループが存在しない
  LGAppService --> LGController : ResourceNotFoundException
  LGController --> Client : 404 Not Found
else レッスングループが存在する
  LGRepo --> LGAppService : LessonGroup

  LGAppService -> LGRepo : updateLessonGroup(lessonGroup.update(title))
  LGRepo -> DB : UPDATE lesson_groups SET title = ?
  DB --> LGRepo : 更新されたLessonGroup
  LGRepo --> LGAppService : LessonGroup

  LGAppService -> LRepo : findLessonsByLessonGroupId(lessonGroupId)
  LRepo -> DB : SELECT * FROM lessons WHERE lesson_group_id = ?
  DB --> LRepo : List<Lesson>
  LRepo --> LGAppService : List<Lesson>

  LGAppService --> LGController : LessonGroupDto（lessons含む）
  LGController --> Client : 200 OK { id, name, lessons[], ... }
end

' ============================================================
' レッスングループ削除
' ============================================================
== レッスングループ削除 (DELETE /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}) ==

Client -> LGController : DELETE /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}

LGController -> LGAppService : deleteLessonGroupById(lessonGroupId)

LGAppService -> LGRepo : findLessonGroupById(lessonGroupId)
LGRepo -> DB : SELECT WHERE id = ?
DB --> LGRepo : Optional<LessonGroup>

note over LGAppService
  レッスングループが存在しなくてもエラーにはしない（冪等性）
end note

alt レッスングループが存在する場合のみ削除
  LGAppService -> LGRepo : deleteLessonGroupById(lessonGroupId)
  LGRepo -> DB : DELETE FROM lesson_groups WHERE id = ?
  DB --> LGRepo : ok
end

LGAppService --> LGController : void
LGController --> Client : 204 No Content

' ============================================================
' コース内レッスン一覧取得（グループ別）
' ============================================================
== コース内レッスン一覧取得 (GET /api/courses/{courseId}/lessons) ==

Client -> CController : GET /api/courses/{courseId}/lessons

CController -> LAppService : findLessonsGroupedByLessonGroup(courseId)

LAppService -> LRepo : findLessonsGroupedByLessonGroup(courseId)
LRepo -> DB : SELECT lesson_groups LEFT JOIN lessons\nWHERE course_id = ?\nORDER BY lesson_group_order, lesson_order
DB --> LRepo : JOINした行（LessonGroupWithLessonRow[]）
note over LRepo
  行をレッスングループ単位で入れ子にまとめ
  List<LessonGroupWithLessons> に変換（toDomainList）
end note
LRepo --> LAppService : List<LessonGroupWithLessons>

LAppService -> LAppService : 各グループを LessonGroupDto に変換し\nCourseLessonsDto を組み立て
LAppService --> CController : CourseLessonsDto
CController --> Client : 200 OK { courseId, lessonGroups: [{ id, name, lessons: [...] }] }

' ============================================================
' レッスン詳細取得（管理者向け）
' ============================================================
== レッスン詳細取得 (GET /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}/lessons/{lessonId}) ==

Client -> LController : GET /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}/lessons/{lessonId}

LController -> LAppService : findLessonById(courseId, lessonGroupId, lessonId)

LAppService -> LRepo : findById(lessonId)
LRepo -> DB : SELECT WHERE id = ?
DB --> LRepo : Optional<Lesson>

alt レッスンが存在しない
  LAppService --> LController : ResourceNotFoundException
  LController --> Client : 404 Not Found
else レッスンが存在する
  LRepo --> LAppService : Lesson
  LAppService -> LAppService : courseId・lessonGroupIdが一致するか検証
  alt 不一致
    LAppService --> LController : ResourceNotFoundException
    LController --> Client : 404 Not Found
  else 一致
    LAppService --> LController : LessonDto
    LController --> Client : 200 OK { id, title, content, videoUrl, lessonOrder, ... }
  end
end

' ============================================================
' レッスン新規作成
' ============================================================
== レッスン新規作成 (POST /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}/lessons) ==

Client -> LController : POST /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}/lessons\n{ title, content, videoUrl }

LController -> LAppService : createLesson(LessonCreateCommand)

LAppService -> LGRepo : findLessonGroupById(lessonGroupId)
LGRepo -> DB : SELECT FROM lesson_groups WHERE id = ?
DB --> LGRepo : Optional<LessonGroup>

alt レッスングループが存在しない、またはパスのコースに属さない
  LAppService --> LController : ResourceNotFoundException
  LController --> Client : 404 Not Found
  note right of LAppService
    存在チェックをしないまま登録すると外部キー制約違反となり、
    クライアント起因の誤りが500として返ってしまうため、事前に検証する。
  end note
else レッスングループが存在し、パスのコースに属する
  LGRepo --> LAppService : LessonGroup

  LAppService -> LDomainService : issueLessonOrder(lessonGroupId)
  LDomainService -> LRepo : 当該レッスングループの最大lessonOrderを取得
  LRepo -> DB : SELECT MAX(lesson_order) WHERE lesson_group_id = ?
  DB --> LRepo : maxOrder
  LRepo --> LDomainService : maxOrder
  LDomainService --> LAppService : 新しいOrder（末尾に追加）

  LAppService -> LRepo : createLesson(Lesson.create(..., order))
  LRepo -> DB : INSERT INTO lessons
  DB --> LRepo : 作成されたLesson
  LRepo --> LAppService : Lesson

  LAppService --> LController : LessonDto
  LController --> Client : 200 OK { id, title, lessonOrder, ... }
end

' ============================================================
' レッスン更新
' ============================================================
== レッスン更新 (PUT /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}/lessons/{lessonId}) ==

Client -> LController : PUT /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}/lessons/{lessonId}\n{ title, content, videoUrl }

LController -> LAppService : updateLesson(LessonUpdateCommand)

LAppService -> LRepo : findById(lessonId)
LRepo -> DB : SELECT WHERE id = ?
DB --> LRepo : Optional<Lesson>

alt レッスンが存在しない
  LAppService --> LController : ResourceNotFoundException
  LController --> Client : 404 Not Found
else レッスンが存在する
  LRepo --> LAppService : Lesson

  LAppService -> LRepo : updateLesson(lesson.update(...))
  LRepo -> DB : UPDATE lessons SET ...
  DB --> LRepo : 更新されたLesson
  LRepo --> LAppService : Lesson

  LAppService --> LController : LessonDto
  LController --> Client : 200 OK { id, title, content, videoUrl, ... }
end

' ============================================================
' レッスン削除
' ============================================================
== レッスン削除 (DELETE /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}/lessons/{lessonId}) ==

Client -> LController : DELETE /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}/lessons/{lessonId}

LController -> LAppService : deleteLessonById(lessonId)

LAppService -> LRepo : findById(lessonId)
LRepo -> DB : SELECT WHERE id = ?
DB --> LRepo : Optional<Lesson>

note over LAppService
  レッスンが存在しなくてもエラーにはしない（冪等性）
end note

alt レッスンが存在する場合のみ削除
  LAppService -> LRepo : deleteLessonById(lessonId)
  LRepo -> DB : DELETE FROM lessons WHERE id = ?
  DB --> LRepo : ok
end

LAppService --> LController : void
LController --> Client : 204 No Content

' ============================================================
' レッスン並び順更新
' ============================================================
== レッスン並び順更新 (PUT .../lessons/{lessonId}/order) ==

Client -> LController : PUT /api/courses/{courseId}/lesson-groups/{lessonGroupId}/lessons/{lessonId}/order\n{ precedingLessonId, followingLessonId }

note over Client
  ドラッグ&ドロップで並び替えた際に呼び出す。
  移動先の前後のレッスンIDを渡す。
  前後どちらか一方がnullの場合は先頭または末尾への移動を意味する。
end note

LController -> LAppService : updateLessonOrder(LessonOrderUpdateCommand)

LAppService -> LRepo : findByIdIn([targetId, precedingId, followingId])
LRepo -> DB : SELECT WHERE id IN (...)
DB --> LRepo : List<Lesson>
LRepo --> LAppService : List<Lesson>

LAppService -> LDomainService : calculateNewOrder(precedingOrder, followingOrder)
note over LDomainService
  前後のorderから新しい順序値を計算する。
  ・先頭移動(preceding=null): followingOrder / 2
  ・末尾移動(following=null): precedingOrder + INTERVAL_ORDER(1024)
  ・中間移動: (precedingOrder + followingOrder) / 2
end note
LDomainService --> LAppService : newOrder (BigDecimal)

LAppService -> LRepo : updateLesson(targetLesson.updateOrder(newOrder))
LRepo -> DB : UPDATE lessons SET lesson_order = ? WHERE id = ?
DB --> LRepo : 更新されたLesson
LRepo --> LAppService : Lesson

LAppService --> LController : LessonDto
LController --> Client : 200 OK { id, lessonOrder（新しい値）, ... }

' ============================================================
' 全レッスンCSVエクスポート
' ============================================================
== 全レッスンCSVエクスポート (GET /api/courses/lessons/export) ==
note over Client
  管理者のみ（ADMIN）。全レッスンをコース・グループ情報付きで出力する。
end note

Client -> CController : GET /api/courses/lessons/export

CController -> LAppService : exportAllLessonsCsv()

LAppService -> LRepo : findAllLessons()
LRepo -> DB : SELECT lessons JOIN courses JOIN lesson_groups\nORDER BY course_id, lesson_group_order, lesson_order
DB --> LRepo : 全レッスン（コース・グループ情報付き）
LRepo --> LAppService : List<LessonWithCourseAndLessonGroup>

LAppService -> LAppService : CSVバイト列生成\n（BOM付きUTF-8・カンマ/ダブルクォートエスケープ）\n0件でもヘッダー行のみ返す

LAppService --> CController : ByteArrayResource (CSVバイト列)
CController --> Client : 200 OK\nContent-Type: text/csv\nContent-Disposition: attachment; filename=lessons.csv

' ============================================================
' レッスンCSVインポート（コース内を洗い替え）
' ============================================================
== レッスンCSVインポート (POST /api/courses/{courseId}/lessons/import) ==
note over Client
  管理者のみ（ADMIN）。対象コースのレッスン構成をCSV内容で洗い替える（単一トランザクション）。
end note

Client -> CController : POST /api/courses/{courseId}/lessons/import\nmultipart/form-data（file=lessons.csv）

CController -> LAppService : importLessonsCsv(LessonImportCommand)

LAppService -> CourseRepo : findCourseById(courseId)
CourseRepo -> DB : SELECT FROM courses WHERE id = ?
DB --> CourseRepo : Optional<Course>

alt コースが存在しない
  LAppService --> CController : ResourceNotFoundException
  CController --> Client : 404 Not Found
else コースが存在する
  CourseRepo --> LAppService : Course

  LAppService -> LAppService : CSV行をレッスングループタイトル単位に集約

  LAppService -> LRepo : deleteLessonsByCourseId(courseId)
  LRepo -> DB : DELETE FROM lessons WHERE course_id = ?\n（user_lessons も ON DELETE CASCADE で削除）
  DB --> LRepo : ok
  LAppService -> LGRepo : deleteLessonGroupsByCourseId(courseId)
  LGRepo -> DB : DELETE FROM lesson_groups WHERE course_id = ?
  DB --> LGRepo : ok

  LAppService -> LAppService : レッスングループとレッスンを生成\n（CSV初出順に order 採番。IDはアプリ側で採番する）
  note right of LAppService
    IDをアプリ側で採番するため、登録前に親のIDが確定する。
    そのためレッスングループを1件ずつINSERTして採番結果を待つ必要がなく、
    親子それぞれ1回の一括登録で完結する。
  end note

  LAppService -> LGRepo : createLessonGroups(lessonGroups)
  LGRepo -> DB : INSERT INTO lesson_groups（一括）
  DB --> LGRepo : ok
  LAppService -> LRepo : createLessons(lessons)（グループ内順に order 採番）
  LRepo -> DB : INSERT INTO lessons（一括）
  DB --> LRepo : ok

  LAppService --> CController : LessonImportResponseDto\n{ importedLessonGroupCount, importedLessonCount }
  CController --> Client : 200 OK { importedLessonGroupCount, importedLessonCount }
end

@enduml
